{"4917090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Golf Superstore Simulator", "steam_appid": 4917090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with an empty store, $1,000, and a computer in the backroom. That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order your first shipment, haul the box out, and stock the shelf yourself. A customer walks in, grabs what they need, and checks out at your register. That's the loop — and it's more satisfying than it has any right to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/a16efbbcecd0dc831ac2ab6d11fdfab2.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1346 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is hands-on. You carry the delivery boxes, you open them, you decide what goes where. Place your shelves, rotate them how you like, set your prices, and see what sells. The store looks exactly how you built it — because you did build it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/909786eebf475905efebfdae92d759bc.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1357 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The product catalog runs from cheap refurbished golf balls all the way up to premium Titleridge iron sets and drivers. You won't have access to everything on day one — you'll earn it as your store grows and your level climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/5205b139c5e77a441dcdf22f63c9c153.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1488 height=1007 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no handholding here. Understock and customers leave empty handed. Overprice and they walk. Find the balance, grow your margins, and reinvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a golf superstore. Run it like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/9508cb09a5e29f9186a2612a54521ce8.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1360 height=920 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with an empty store, $1,000, and a computer in the backroom. That's it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order your first shipment, haul the box out, and stock the shelf yourself. A customer walks in, grabs what they need, and checks out at your register. That's the loop — and it's more satisfying than it has any right to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/a16efbbcecd0dc831ac2ab6d11fdfab2.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1346 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is hands-on. You carry the delivery boxes, you open them, you decide what goes where. Place your shelves, rotate them how you like, set your prices, and see what sells. The store looks exactly how you built it — because you did build it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/909786eebf475905efebfdae92d759bc.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1357 height=894 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The product catalog runs from cheap refurbished golf balls all the way up to premium Titleridge iron sets and drivers. You won't have access to everything on day one — you'll earn it as your store grows and your level climbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/5205b139c5e77a441dcdf22f63c9c153.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1488 height=1007 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no handholding here. Understock and customers leave empty handed. Overprice and they walk. Find the balance, grow your margins, and reinvest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a golf superstore. Run it like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/extras/9508cb09a5e29f9186a2612a54521ce8.avif?t=1785767564\" width=1360 height=920 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Run your own golf superstore from the ground up. Order inventory, stock shelves by hand, set your own prices, and keep customers happy. Grow from a single ball bin to a fully stocked golf empire — one sale at a time.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/85e88b6c536130e0c0befd580c64a18e3f1db43e/header.jpg?t=1785767564", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/00859d51379209c93a1d62a104ff21bb5a05727b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785767564", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4917090/00859d51379209c93a1d62a104ff21bb5a05727b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785767564", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD RX 470 (2GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommen